#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankGridaniaMaleText, row = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = GCRankUldahMaleText, row = global number 54 (the player's rank in the Immortal Flames, 0 when not a member), column = 8 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
